  "body": "Wake up to the sunshine of Takapuna – Your opportunity to secure a smart buy in a sought-after location.\r\n\r\nAt an attractive asking price of just $457,000, this beautifully presented one-bedroom apartment presents an exciting opportunity for both owner-occupiers and savvy investors.\r\n\r\nPerfectly suited to professionals, couples, downsizers or astute investors, this apartment offers an affordable entry into the heart of Takapuna. Whether you are looking for a place to call home or a smart addition to your investment portfolio, this is an opportunity that makes practical and financial sense.\r\n\r\nFrom the moment you step inside, there is an immediate sense of calm. Perfectly positioned in the heart of Takapuna, this apartment feels wonderfully peaceful, with the balcony opening to a soothing green outlook over the Takapuna Croquet Club. The bedroom flows beautifully from the living area through to the ensuite and balcony, with doors allowing it to become a private retreat when desired.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen is fully equipped with an oven, cooktop, rangehood, dishwasher, fridge and washing machine, so you can simply bring your furniture and settle in. Residents also enjoy access to the heated swimming pool and barbecue area, adding even more lifestyle appeal.\r\n\r\nStep outside and enjoy the best of Takapuna on foot — the beach, Lake Pupuke, cafés, restaurants, boutique shopping and everyday amenities are all within easy reach. Excellent public transport and motorway access make commuting equally convenient, while the established Sargeson Apartments community offers a comfortable and peaceful place to call home.\r\n\r\nPriced to attract attention – Don't miss this opportunity!\r\n\r\nWhether you're stepping onto the property ladder, looking to downsize, or seeking an affordable investment in one of Auckland's most desirable locations, this apartment offers exceptional value and flexibility.\r\n\r\nEnjoy a little more sunshine, a little more lifestyle, every day in Takapuna.\r\n\r\nSecure you home in Heart of Takapuna – Contact Julia to arrange a private viewing today! \r\nOpenhome: Saturday 12:00pm-12:30pm",
